  [PASS] A4  CONTROL: exponential AQUAL and nu_RAR both -> sqrt(a0 g_bar) in deep MOND (same BTFR zero-point)   (at y<=1e-4: exp within 0.251%, nu_RAR within 0.501% of sqrt(a0 g_bar))

