      footing     nu_RAR rms   exp rms   d(rms)    nu_RAR med   exp med
      canonical       0.1453    0.1613  +0.0160       +0.0302   +0.0746
      alt             0.1421    0.1507  +0.0086       +0.0049   +0.0467
